# Safety boundary

Bind the API to 127.0.0.1. Validate Host and Origin. No wildcard CORS. Session token in memory, authorization header on API calls.

The CLI chooses the root once. Routes accept opaque ids, never arbitrary paths.

Do not follow symlinks by default. Do not import or run inspected project configuration. Do not install that project's packages.

Default exports omit source text and absolute paths. Recheck content hashes before serving evidence.
